  "question": {
    "text": "In an ac circuit, the instantaneous current is zero, when the instantaneous voltage is maximum. In this case, the source may be connected to :\nA. pure inductor.\nB. pure capacitor.\nC. pure resistor.\nD. combination of an inductor and capacitor.\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
